- # Trading Upbit Skill
- This skill implements an automated trading strategy using:
- - Volatility Breakout (Daily)
- - 1H Bullish Confirmation
- - PnL-based Exit
- - Top Volume Dynamic Monitoring
- - Near-Breakout Candidate Detection
- ## Tools
- ### monitor_once
- ### worker_once
- ### smoke_test
- ## Strategy Logic
- ### Buy Condition
- 1. target = today_open + (yesterday_high - yesterday_low) * k
- 2. current_price >= target
- 3. 1H candle close > open
- ### Near Candidate
- last / target >= breakoutNearThreshold (default 0.98)
- If near occurs 3 consecutive times → WATCH_CANDIDATE event emitted.
- ### Sell Condition
- PnL = (current_price - avg_buy_price) / avg_buy_price
- Sell when:
- - PnL >= targetProfit
- - OR PnL <= stopLoss
- ## Cron Recommendation
- Use isolated session cron jobs in OpenClaw.
